#: ../../source/index.rst:69 ac1bba63c0d949618bb5032a2e4e75d1
msgid ""
"Are you looking to enhance your trading strategies with the power of "
"Python and machine learning? Then you need to check out **PyBroker**! "
"This Python framework is designed for developing algorithmic trading "
"strategies, with a focus on strategies that use machine learning. With "
"PyBroker, you can easily create and fine-tune trading rules, build "
"powerful models, and gain valuable insights into your strategy's "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"你是否希望借助 Python 和机器学习的力量来优化你的交易策略？那么你需要了解一下 PyBroker！这个 Python "
"框架专为开发算法交易策略而设计，尤其关注使用机器学习的策略。借助 "
"PyBroker，你可以轻松创建和微调交易规则，构建强大的模型，并深入了解你的策略表现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:77 98ae3731120a439ea4234d4cc33a6f10
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "重要特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:79 bacac164d62c4f5a9b27032e88ea72e4
msgid ""
"A super-fast backtesting engine built in `NumPy <https://numpy.org/>`_  "
"and accelerated with `Numba <https://numba.pydata.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"一个基于 `NumPy <https://numpy.org/>`_ 并通过 `Numba "
"<https://numba.pydata.org/>`_ 加速的超快回测引擎。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:80 5b651938810b41fea0d07c954addc3e2
msgid ""
"The ability to create and execute trading rules and models across "
"multiple instruments with ease."
msgstr "能轻松地在多个金融工具上创建和执行交易规则和模型。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:81 94ffdc60fc7648b486db656d3e86d6ce
msgid ""
"Access to historical data from `Alpaca <https://alpaca.markets/>`_, "
"`Yahoo Finance <https://finance.yahoo.com/>`_, `AKShare "
"<https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`_, or from `your own data provider "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/7.%20Creating%20a%20Custom%20Data%20Source.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"可以轻松从 `Alpaca <https://alpaca.markets/>`_, `Yahoo Finance "
"<https://finance.yahoo.com/>`_, `AKShare "
"<https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`_, 或者从 `自定义的数据源 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/7.%20Creating%20a%20Custom%20Data%20Source.html>`_"
" 来获取历史数据。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:82 c924296b5a6a4be89b95794df974bf7c
msgid ""
"The option to train and backtest models using `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
"#Walkforward-Analysis>`_, which simulates how the strategy would perform "
"during actual trading."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
"#Walkforward-Analysis>`_, 来训练和回测模型，该方法模拟了策略在实际交易中的表现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:83 a01619ee63764074a561c3252eabf8b6
msgid ""
"More reliable trading metrics that use randomized `bootstrapping "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bootstrapping_(statistics)>`_ to provide "
"more accurate results."
msgstr ""
"使用随机 `bootstrapping "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bootstrapping_(statistics)>`_ "
"来提供更准确的策略回测结果。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:84 4b7d805e6efe4c19857079df40eee1a3
msgid ""
"Caching of downloaded data, indicators, and models to speed up your "
"development process."
msgstr "缓存已下载的数据、指标和模型来加速你的开发过程。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:85 11f8d615ebbe4317941f4d55eda2cf14
msgid "Parallelized computations that enable faster performance."
msgstr "用并行计算来获得更高的性能。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:87 a3ff195688bf4f2fbf5cbc6f9b52b490
msgid ""
"With PyBroker, you'll have all the tools you need to create winning "
"trading strategies backed by data and machine learning. Start using "
"PyBroker today and take your trading to the next level!"
msgstr ""
"通过使用 PyBroker，你将拥有所有必要的工具来创建基于数据和机器学习支持的交易策略。从今天开始用 "
"PyBroker，将你的交易提升到一个新的高度！"

